\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces VUCCA operates in three stages: (1) items are embedded and clustered into semantic groups, (2) conformal prediction intervals quantify per-cluster miss-rate uncertainty, and (3) a soft-sigmoid bias function adjusts admission thresholds. ACI with exponential weighting handles non-stationary workloads.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig1}{{1}{3}{VUCCA operates in three stages: (1) items are embedded and clustered into semantic groups, (2) conformal prediction intervals quantify per-cluster miss-rate uncertainty, and (3) a soft-sigmoid bias function adjusts admission thresholds. ACI with exponential weighting handles non-stationary workloads}{figure.1}{}}
